# Aether Events Directory
#
# This directory holds the NDJSON event stream that is the shared
# observable truth between the Go runtime and the TypeScript control plane.
#
# File: .aether/events/current.ndjson
# Format: One JSON object per line (newline-delimited JSON)
# Shape: { "type": "...", "timestamp": "...", "payload": { ... } }
#
# Both Go and TypeScript append to and read from this file concurrently.
# The event stream is created on demand by InitEventStream() (Go) or
# createEventStream() (TS).
